== About me
I am currently a Research Fellow (Postdoctoral Researcher) in the [https://www.math.nus.edu.sg/ Department of Mathematics] at the [https://nus.edu.sg/ National University of Singapore], where I am advised by [https://vyftan.github.io/ Prof. Vincent Y. F. Tan]. Before joining NUS, I completed my Ph.D. in computer science at [https://www.sjtu.edu.cn/ Shanghai Jiao Tong University] under the supervision of [https://shuaili8.github.io/ Prof. Shuai Li]. I received a B.Eng. in software engineering from [https://www.sdu.edu.cn/ Shandong University] in 2021.

== Education 
- Ph.D. in Computer Science, [https://www.sjtu.edu.cn/ Shanghai Jiao Tong University], 2021 - 2026
- B.Eng. in Software Engineering, [https://www.sdu.edu.cn/ Shandong University], Sept. 2017 - Jun. 2021
- High School Student, [http://www.hnssyzx.cn/ Henan Experimental High School],  Sept. 2014 - Jun. 2017

== Research Interests 
I am broadly interested in learning theory, with a particular focus on sequential decision-making problems, including
- Online Learning
- Reinforcement Learning
- Learning in Games

